Z||000000||CanadianGT||09-01-2001||12:30 AM||||Well I juet finished Moving all my stuff into my new house at college, and on my way back on the QEW I saw sweet Fiero with tags that said TNT GT. I got my Friend who was driving to pull up next to him, and I rolled down my window and just looked, and then gave him the thumbs up. I am almost positive that I saw this car last year at the GTA fiero show, and was wondering if it was someones here?  Does anyone know?? I thought it said darkngihts on it too, but it was very dark out so it was hard to tell.  Is this your Northstar Jay, because for some reason ,something is telling me it is?  If it was, then that was me given ya the thumbs up!<BR>PeAcE<BR>Kyle||||reg||1
